  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Bounded separately sampled records. A successful envelope does not imply every source is available or a global atomic snapshot. Failed records contain no data. Runtime identity is controller-scoped; loaded_snapshot identifies an owner-selected, successfully loaded and verified immutable trust snapshot; a configured pin alone cannot be an ok active-trust record. It does not attest TLS connectivity or replacement of existing stream anchors. Additional cross-field constraints are enforced by observation_replay.py. Self/direct_child refer to the authenticated provider source.pid, not the consuming caller_pid. Runtime/trust owner is likewise the provider. service.interface_version is this observation metadata revision, not the target service protocol."
